# Catppuccin Latte with ANSI black (palette 0) set to the base colour instead
# of the stock mid gray #5c5f77. herdr (config/herdr/config.toml, shared with
# the omarchy hosts) draws its active tab as black text on the blue accent and
# the omarchy palettes have a dark black, so the config stays untouched and
# this theme makes black read on Latte's dark blue (#1e66f5) instead. The
# cost is that any black-on-background text is invisible in light mode.
